<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS4" title="In Appendix D Additional Experiments ‣ Hallucination-aware Intermediate Representation Edit in Large Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.4 </span>Data Size for HIRE’s Editor Training</span></a></li>
